WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
That brings us to the conclusion of our training today.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.480
As we wrap up, always remember the message on this final slide.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.380
Prevention and awareness are truly your most powerful tools for avoiding injury and illness

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.320
before they even happen.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.200
Thank you so much for your time and for your dedication to becoming an everyday hero.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.959
I hope you're leaving today feeling more confident, more prepared, and ready to step up whenever

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:25.520
someone is in need.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.639
Goodbye for now and stay safe out there.

